      "message": "NPCX_HIPMCTL Bit 1 is PM channel OBE interrupt enable bit. The OBE interrupt using flow must be the following: \n1.    write NPCX_HIPMDO(send data to host)\n2.    Set OBEIE bit in the NPCX_HIPMCTL register.\n3.    task_enable_irq(NPCX_IRQ_PM_CHAN_OBE)\nThere isn\u0027t any function that uses PM channel OBE interrupt(NPCX_IRQ_PM_CHAN_OBE) now. To avoid that someone who uses the PM channel OBE interrupt encounters spurious interrupt in the future, we send this patch which removes PM channel OBE interrupt enable.",
